"ຮ້ວຍລະ"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:19
msgid ""
"This page lets you configure the colors in which your chart is displayed. "
"Each part of the chart can be assigned a different color."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງສີທີ່ ຈະໃຊ້"
"ສະແດງຜົນແຜນພູມທີ່ໜ້ານີ້"
"ໂດຍແຕ່ລະ"
"ຂອງແແຜນພູມ "
"ສາມາດກຳນົດສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:25
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "ສີ"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:30
msgid "&Grid color:"
msgstr "ສີ&ກຣີດ:"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:36
msgid ""
"Here you can configure the color that is used for the chart grid. Of course, "
"this setting will only take effect if grid drawing is turned on."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງສີທີຈະໃຊ້"
"ສະແດງກຣີດຂອງແຜນພູມໄດ້ທີນີ້"
"่ແນ່ນອນ ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະ ມີຜົນກັບກຣີດເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ຖ້າມີການກຳໃຫ້ມີການສະແດງກຣີດດ້ວຍ"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:42
msgid "&Line color:"
msgstr "ສີເສັ้້&น:"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:48
msgid "This is the color that is used for drawing lines like axes."
msgstr "ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າສີທີຈະໃຊ້ກັບການວາດເສັ້ນເຊັ່ນແກນຕ່າງໆ"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:52
msgid "&Plot color:"
msgstr "ສີການ&ວາດແຜນພູມ:"

#: kchartColorConfigPage.cc:58
msgid "This color is used for plotting some chart aspects, most notably in pies."
